  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wildlife Without Borders-Western Hemisphere</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Mexico are being lost at an alarming rate despite its importance as biodiversity and water reservoirs. In response to this challenge, Pronatura Mexico A.C developed a certificate course on cloud forest restoration as a tool to strengthen the capacities of decision makers, field technicians, natural resources administrators, conservation leaders, university students, and land owners from all over Mexico. Through this grant, the Recipient will 1) update and improve the quality of the current virtual training platform, learning tools (webinars and video clips) and teaching materials; 2) deliver the 3rd edition of the Mesophilic Cloud Forest Restoration Techniques certificate, a 5 month on-line and field based course for at least 35 participants; and 3) provide technical support and guidance to the certificate participants in the implementation of several cloud forest conservation projects in different regions of Mexico. .&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
